      "post_id": "91183",
      "author_handle": "Mano",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 8 years 2 weeks ago",
      "body": "Hi,\nI work for ManoMano as head of the UK business community and I'm looking to bring in some new outside experts who can provide independent advice on products and projects.\nWe've found that this role fits nicely with the desires of people who require a certain level of flexibility but wish to keep occupied and continue earning money.  The role is independent of ManoMano so there is no obligation in terms of which day and time you should be working.  Payments are made on a commission basis so experts can sign up for self-declaration very quickly and easily.\nIdeally, I am looking for people that have a reasonable level of computer proficiency, someone that can type reasonably fast and knows how to use FaceBook or LinkedIn will have those skills, combined with an understanding of one of the following areas of knowledge:\nDIY\nGardening and swimming pools\nPlumbing and heating\nElectrics\nUnfortunately, I'm not able to offer a large number of positions, I'm looking for a maximum of 10 people but I would really like to work with people who bring a wealth of practical and life experience to the role.\nIf this is of interest to you, feel free to contact me via PM.\nBest regards,\nStuart Woodrow\nManoMano UK Business Community Manager",
